oke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="91.6" y1="169.7" x2="99.6" y2="161.7" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="306.4" y1="78.5" x2="314.4" y2="86.5" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="306.4" y1="86.5" x2="314.4" y2="78.5" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="105.6" y="173.7" font-size="12" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">(0.20, 1.10)</text><text x="320.4" y="90.5" font-size="12" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">(0.80, 2.30)</text></svg>', 'A best-fit line on a graph of lg y against lg x through the points (0.20, 1.10) and (0.80, 2.30).'),
('4a23f061-1ab7-5215-8a94-eb69ef23050d', '50ff4bc9-26e6-445a-abf4-2137ff76c6eb', 'c32a7123-0b11-417e-a3dd-2024f9fdf5d2', 'a-level', 'P2.1', '9702 coursebook P2.1 · Planning and analysis', 33, 33, 'A line on a graph of lg y against lg x passes through (0.30, 0.95) and (0.90, 2.15). For y = kxⁿ, calculate k.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '2.239', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, 'n = (2.15 − 0.95) ÷ (0.90 − 0.30) = 2.0. lg k = 0.95 − 2.0 × 0.30 = 0.35, so k = 10^0.35 = 2.24. Mark scheme (4 marks). C1: gradient. M1: intercept from a point. C1: inverse log. A1: k = 2.24.', 4, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg51ffcbe8-t fg51ffcbe8-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg51ffcbe8-t">Log–log line</title><desc id="fg51ffcbe8-d">A straight line on a graph of lg y against lg x through (0.30, 0.95) and (0.90, 2.15).</desc><line x1="33" y1="34" x2="33" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="102.8" y1="34" x2="102.8" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="172.6" y1="34" x2="172.6" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="242.4" y1="34" x2="242.4" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="312.2" y1="34" x2="312.2" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="382" y1="34" x2="382" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="33" y1="242" x2="382" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke