n:round;stroke-dasharray:3 2"/><text x="201.6" y="54" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">gate A</text><path d="M328.4,136 L328.4,66 L360.4,66 L360.4,136" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="330.4" y1="95" x2="358.4" y2="95" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:3 2"/><text x="344.4" y="54" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">gate B</text><polygon points="201.6,162 207.9,159 207.9,165" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke:none"/><line x1="206.5" y1="162" x2="339.5" y2="162" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="344.4,162 338.1,165 338.1,159" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke:none"/><text x="273" y="174" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">0.60 m</text></svg>', 'A trolley carrying a 4.0 cm card runs along a track through light gates A and B, 0.60 m apart.')
