('42a1a5db-7afd-5763-a5a4-f5f9c6efae9f', '50ff4bc9-26e6-445a-abf4-2137ff76c6eb', 'ce473f5f-8864-4efe-be59-be54ed9c0caa', 'a-level', 'P2.3', '9702 coursebook P2.3 · Analysis of the data', 47, 47, 'For a thin converging lens, uv = f(u + v). A student finds u = 20 cm, v = 60 cm and u = 30 cm, v = 30 cm. (a) Calculate uv and u + v for each pair. (b) Find f from the gradient of uv against (u + v), in cm.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '15 cm', 'cm', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) 1200 cm² and 80 cm; 900 cm² and 60 cm. (b) f = gradient = (1200 − 900) ÷ (80 − 60) = 15 cm. Mark scheme (5 marks). C1: uv values. C1: u + v values. M1: gradient = f. C1: substitution. A1: f = 15 cm.', 5, NULL, NULL),
('59aa52ff-234b-5705-bc79-54c87899fff0', '50ff4bc9-26e6-445a-abf4-2137ff76c6eb', 'ce473f5f-8864-4efe-be59-be54ed9c0caa', 'a-level', 'P2.3', '9702 coursebook P2.3 · Analysis of the data', 48, 48, 'A graph of acceleration a against displacement x for an oscillator is a straight line through the origin with gradient −158 s⁻². (a) Explain why this shows simple harmonic motion. (b) Calculate the angular frequency. (c) Calculate the frequency.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '2.001', 'Hz', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) a ∝ −x. (b) ω = √158 = 12.57 rad s⁻¹. (c) f = 12.57 ÷ 2π = 2.00 Hz. Mark scheme (6 marks). B1: a proportional to −x. M1: gradient = −ω². C1: ω. M1: f = ω/2π. C1: value. A1: f = 2.00 Hz.', 6, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg06187917-t fg06187917-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg06187917-t">Acceleration against displacement</title><desc id="fg06187917-d">A straight line through the origin with negative gradient −158 s⁻² on a graph of acceleration against displacement.</desc><line x1="29.4" y1="34" x2="29.4" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="117.6" y1="34" x2="117.6" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="205.7" y1="34" x2="205.7" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="293.9" y1="34" x2="293.9" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="382" y1="34" x2="382" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="29.4" y1="242" x2="382" y2="242" style="strok