 x="26" y="34" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">3.0</text><text x="207.5" y="274" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">lg (T / K)</text><text x="29" y="14" font-size="14" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">lg (P / W)</text><polyline points="67.9,231.1 347.1,68.8" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="98.8" y1="206.8" x2="106.8" y2="214.8" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="98.8" y1="214.8" x2="106.8" y2="206.8" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="308.2" y1="85.1" x2="316.2" y2="93.1" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="308.2" y1="93.1" x2="316.2" y2="85.1" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="112.8" y="218.8" font-size="12" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">(3.20, 1.30)</text><text x="322.2" y="97.1" font-size="12" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">(3.50, 2.47)</text><line x1="27" y1="232" x2="39" y2="226" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="27" y1="226" x2="39" y2="220" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/></svg>', 'A straight line on a graph of lg P against lg T through (3.20, 1.30) and (3.50, 2.47).'),
('c6a1dfb6-bff7-5e50-a29a-d2c6164ca0af', '50ff4bc9-26e6-445a-abf4-2137ff76c6eb', 'ce473f5f-8864-4efe-be59-be54ed9c0caa', 'a-level', 'P2.3', '9702 coursebook P2.3 · Analysis of the data', 50, 50, 'Light of intensity I passes through n identical filters: I = I₀rⁿ. A graph of lg I against n has gradient −0.097. (a) Explain why the graph is a straight line. (b) Calculate r, the fraction transmitted by one filter.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '0.7998', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) lg I = lg I₀ + n lg r, linear in n. (b) lg r = −0.097, so r = 10^(−0.097) = 0.800. Mark scheme (5 marks). B1: lg form. B1: gradient = lg r. M1: inverse log. C1: value. A1: r = 0.800.', 5, NULL, NULL),
('b30406a0-f75f-5205-b150-1c7669bc6283', '50ff4bc9-26e6-445a-abf4-2137ff76c6eb', 'ce473f5f-8864-4efe-be59-be54ed9c0caa', 'a-level', 'P2.3', '9702 coursebook P2.3 · Analysis of the data', 51, 51, 'In an experiment, V = 1.00, 2.00, 3.00, 4.00 V across a component give I = 0.050, 0.141, 0.260, 0.400 A. (a) Show that I is not proportional to V. (b) Assuming I = kVⁿ, use the first and last readings to find n.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '1.5', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) I/V = 0.050, 0.0705, 0.0867, 0.100: not constant. (b) n = (lg 0.400 − lg 0.050) ÷ (lg 4.00 − lg 1.00) = 1.50. Mark scheme (6 marks). C1: ratio I/V calculated. B1: ratio not constant. M1: log–log gradient. C1: substitution. C1: value. A1: n = 1.50.', 6, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 410" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg86c419b5-t fg86c419b5-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg86c419b5-t">Current against voltage</title><desc id="fg86c419b5-d">Table and graph of current against p.d. for a component: (1.00, 0.050), (2.00, 0.141), (3.00, 0.260), (4.00, 0.400), on a curve bending upwards.</desc><g transform="translate(0,0)"><rect x="140.9" y="8" width="118.3" height="140" rx="0" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><rect x="140.9" y="8" width="118.3" height="28" rx="0" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:var(--fig-fill,rgba(29,78,216,0.10));stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="170.2" y="22" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor;font-weight:600">V / V</text><text x="229.4" y="22" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor;font-weight:600">I / A</text><line x1="199.6" y1="8" x2="199.6" y2="148" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-