('b3c6b866-8573-5496-9dcb-7d2aed6de62d', '50ff4bc9-26e6-445a-abf4-2137ff76c6eb', '88532559-c2d8-4be9-80c7-6275e8d6cf54', 'a-level', 'P2.4', '9702 coursebook P2.4 · Treatment of uncertainties', 46, 46, 'A graph of T² against mass has gradient 3.95 ± 0.15 s² kg⁻¹, and the spring constant is k = 4π²/gradient. (a) Calculate k. (b) Calculate the absolute uncertainty in k, in N m⁻¹.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '0.3795', 'N m⁻¹', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) k = 4π² ÷ 3.95 = 9.995 N m⁻¹. (b) % = 0.15 ÷ 3.95 × 100 = 3.80 %; Δk = 3.80 ÷ 100 × 9.995 = 0.38 N m⁻¹. Mark scheme (5 marks). C1: k. C1: % in gradient. M1: same % in k. C1: absolute. A1: Δk = 0.38 N m⁻¹.', 5, NULL, NULL),
('2befe065-f412-5b60-ab93-ad10b05596b7', '50ff4bc9-26e6-445a-abf4-2137ff76c6eb', '88532559-c2d8-4be9-80c7-6275e8d6cf54', 'a-level', 'P2.4', '9702 coursebook P2.4 · Treatment of uncertainties', 47, 47, 'A log–log graph gives a best-fit gradient of 1.48 and a worst acceptable gradient of 1.62. (a) State n with its uncertainty. (b) Explain whether the data support n = 1.5. Give the uncertainty in n as your answer.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '0.14', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) Δn = 1.62 − 1.48 = 0.14, so n = 1.48 ± 0.14. (b) 1.5 lies between 1.34 and 1.62, so the data support n = 1.5. Mark scheme (6 marks). C1: Δn = worst − best. C1: n stated with uncertainty. M1: range of n. B1: 1.5 within range. B1: conclusion. A1: Δn = 0.14.', 6, NULL, NULL),
('1dd1b46c-7059-551d-b554-fc307ec6adfb', '50ff4bc9-26e6-445a-abf4-2137ff76c6eb', '88532559-c2d8-4be9-80c7-6275e8d6cf54', 'a-level', 'P2.4', '9702 coursebook P2.4 · Treatment of uncertainties', 48, 48, 'A specific heat capacity is found from c = Pt/(mΔθ). P has 2.0% uncertainty, t 0.5%, m 0.2%, and Δθ = 18.5 ± 0.5 K. (a) Calculate the percentage uncertainty in Δθ. (b) Calculate the percentage uncertainty in c.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '5.403', '%', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) 0.5 ÷ 18.5 × 100 = 2.70 %. (b) % in c = 2.0 + 0.5 + 0.2 + 2.70 = 5.4 %. Mark scheme (5 marks). C1: % in Δθ. M1: add all %. C1: sum. C1: value. A1: % uncertainty = 5.4%.', 5, NULL, NULL),
('2ee8c107-b80c-59a9-9c9c-f94cf2f36245', '50ff4bc9-26e6-445a-abf4-2137ff76c6eb', '88532559-c2d8-4be9-80c7-6275e8d6cf54', 'a-level', 'P2.4', '9702 coursebook P2.4 · Treatment of uncertainties', 49, 49, 'A best-fit line has gradient 2.40 and y-intercept 1.20. The worst acceptable line passes through (1.0, 3.9) and (5.0, 13.3). (a) Calculate the gradient of the worst line. (b) Calculate its y-intercept. (c) Calculate the uncertainty in the y-intercept.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '0.35', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) m = (13.3 − 3.9) ÷ (5.0 − 1.0) = 2.35. (b) c = 3.9 − 2.35 × 1.0 = 1.55. (c) Δc = 1.55 − 1.20 = 0.35. Mark scheme (6 marks). C1: worst gradient. M1: c = y − mx. C1: worst intercept. M1: difference. C1: value. A1: Δc = 0.35.', 6, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg3356aeda-t fg3356aeda-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg3356aeda-t">Worst acceptable line</title><desc id="fg3356aeda-d">Five points with error bars, the best-fit line (gradient 2.40, intercept 1.20) and a shallower worst acceptable line through (1.0, 3.9) and (5.0, 13.3).</desc><line x1="29.4" y1="34" x2="29.4" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="93.5" y1="34" x2="93.5" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="157.6" y1="34" x2="157.6" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="221.7" y1="34" x2="221.7" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="285.8" y1="34" x2="285.8" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stro