d;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polyline points="33,57.8 382,221.2" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polyline points="33,72.6 382,209.9" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:6 4"/><text x="41" y="47.8" font-size="12" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">1.52</text><text x="41" y="96.6" font-size="12" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">1.47</text><line x1="27" y1="232" x2="39" y2="226" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="27" y1="226" x2="39" y2="220" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="141.7" y1="14" x2="163.7" y2="14" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="169.7" y="14" font-size="12" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">best fit</text><line x1="233.2" y1="14" x2="255.2" y2="14" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:6 4"/><text x="261.2" y="14" font-size="12" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">worst acceptable</text></svg>', 'Terminal p.d. against current with error bars; the best-fit line meets the V axis at 1.52 V and the worst acceptable line at 1.47 V.'),
('a371d9ac-64a1-5bff-9c81-3b83a94506ca', '50ff4bc9-26e6-445a-abf4-2137ff76c6eb', '88532559-c2d8-4be9-80c7-6275e8d6cf54', 'a-level', 'P2.4', '9702 coursebook P2.4 · Treatment of uncertainties', 51, 51, 'A card of width 5.0 ± 0.1 cm cuts a light gate for 0.0250 ± 0.0005 s, and the trolley mass is 0.200 ± 0.002 kg. (a) Calculate the percentage uncertainty in the speed. (b) Calculate the percentage uncertainty in the kinetic energy.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '9', '%', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) % in v = 0.1 ÷ 5.0 × 100 + 0.0005 ÷ 0.0250 × 100 = 4.0 %. (b) % in E = 1.0 + 2 × 4.0 = 9.0 %. Mark scheme (5 marks). C1: % in width and time. C1: % in v. M1: double for v². C1: add mass. A1: % uncertainty = 9.0%.', 5, NULL, NULL)
