:currentColor">1</text><line x1="20" y1="138" x2="24" y2="138" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="17" y="138" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">2</text><line x1="20" y1="86" x2="24" y2="86" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="17" y="86" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">3</text><line x1="20" y1="34" x2="24" y2="34" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="17" y="34" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">4</text><text x="203" y="274" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">I / A</text><text x="20" y="14" font-size="14" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">V / V</text><line x1="79.7" y1="176.5" x2="87.7" y2="184.5" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="79.7" y1="184.5" x2="87.7" y2="176.5" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="139.3" y1="151.8" x2="147.3" y2="159.8" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="139.3" y1="159.8" x2="147.3" y2="151.8" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="199" y1="128.4" x2="207" y2="136.4" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="199" y1="136.4" x2="207" y2="128.4" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="258.7" y1="97.7" x2="266.7" y2="105.7" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="258.7" y1="105.7" x2="266.7" y2="97.7" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="318.3" y1="75.4" x2="326.3" y2="83.4" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="318.3" y1="83.4" x2="326.3" y2="75.4" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polyline points="24,208.2 382,52.2" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/></svg>', 'A V–I graph for a resistor: the best-fit line through the points is straight but meets the V axis above the origin.'),
('89bc21bb-19bd-5744-8cdd-889a79097325', '50ff4bc9-26e6-445a-abf4-2137ff76c6eb', '8b8b53aa-cac1-4dda-a21f-0e8b114d6d31', 'a-level', 'P2.5', '9702 coursebook P2.5 · Conclusions and evaluation of results', 48, 48, 'Planck''s constant is found from LEDs using h = e × (gradient)/c, where a graph of V against 1/λ has gradient 1.24 × 10⁻⁶ V m. (a) Calculate h, in units of 10⁻³⁴ J s. (b) Calculate the percentage difference from 6.63 × 10⁻³⁴ J s. Take e = 1.60 × 10⁻¹⁹ C and c = 3.00 × 10⁸ m s⁻¹.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '6.613', '10⁻³⁴ J s', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) h = 1.60 × 10⁻¹⁹ × 1.24 × 10⁻⁶ ÷ 3.00 × 10⁸ = 6.61 × 10⁻³⁴ J s. (b) % = (6.63 − 6.61) ÷ 6.63 × 100 ≈ 0.3 %. Mark scheme (5 marks). M1: h = e × gradient/c. C1: substitution. C1: value. C1: % difference. A1: h = 6.61 × 10⁻³⁴ J s.', 5, NULL, NULL),
('117e26f4-32fd-5c0d-9235-d5231ebdd5b2', '50ff4bc9-26e6-445a-abf4-2137ff76c6eb', '8b8b53aa-cac1-4dda-a21f-0e8b114d6d31', 'a-level', 'P2.5', '9702 coursebook P2.5 · Conclusions and evaluation of results', 49, 49, 'A spring constant is found statically as 25.0 ± 0.5 N m⁻¹ and dynamically from k = 4π²/m, where m = 1.62 ± 0.08 s² kg⁻¹. (a) Calculate the dynamic k. (b) Calculate its absolute uncertainty. (c) State whether the two values agree. Give only the answer to (b), in N m⁻¹.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '1.203', 'N m⁻¹', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) k = 4π² ÷ 1.62 = 24.37 N m⁻¹. (b) % = 0.08 ÷ 1.62 × 100 = 4.94 %; Δk = 4.94 ÷ 100 × 24.37 = 1.2 N m⁻¹. (c) The ranges 24.5–25.5 and 23.2–25.6 overlap, so they agree. Mark scheme (6 marks). C1: dynamic k. C1: % uncertainty. M1: absolute uncertainty. C1: ranges. B1: overlap, agree. A1: Δk = 1.2 N m⁻¹.', 6, NULL, NULL),
('e89b6670-46da-5ab5-9e9f-0f83469a3484', '50ff4bc9-26e6-445a-abf4-2137ff76c6eb', '8b8b53aa-cac1-4dda-a21f-0e8b114d6d31', 'a-level', 'P2.5', '9702 coursebook P2.5 · Conclusions and evaluation of results', 50, 50, 'A force–extension graph is straight at first but curves at the highest loads. Which conclusion and evaluation are best?', NULL, 3, 'multiple_choice'::answer_type, 'Hooke''s law holds only up to the limit of proportionality; the spring constant should be found from the straight part only', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, 'Beyond the limit of proportionality F is not proportional to x. Mark scheme (5 marks). C1: linear region identified. C1: limit of proportionality. C1: gradient from straight part. C1: conclusion limited to range. A1: B (Hooke''s law holds only up to the limit of proportionality; the spring constant should be found from the straight part only).', 5, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg315fbf9f-t fg315fbf9f-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg315fbf9f-t">Force against extension</title><desc id="fg315fbf9f-d">Force against extension for a spring: the points lie on a straight line through the origin at first, then curve over at the highest loads.</desc><line x1="24" y1="34" x2="24" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="113.5" y1="34" x2="113.5" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="203" y1="34" x2="203" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="292.5" y1="34" x2="292.5" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="382" y1="34" x2="3